---
description: Select focused report-writing, evidence-review, or document-formatting instructions when drafting, reviewing, or presenting reports.
alwaysApply: false
---

For report tasks, read rules/REPORT_SKILL_ROUTING.md and the relevant skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md.
Do not apply all three skills to a spelling fix or a formatting-only request.
Follow the user's current scope, permitted sources, template, and target application.
Keep factual results separate from interpretation and future work.
Use actual document tools and render the final artifact before claiming layout verification.

When copying this rule to another project, also copy rules/REPORT_SKILL_ROUTING.md and the three skill folders under skills/, preserving these relative paths, or update the paths to their installed locations.
